Package: mastersim
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: FMI co-simulation master
 MasterSim is an FMI co-simulation master program. It supports
 the Functional Mock-Up Interface for Co-Simulation in version
 1.0 and 2.0. Using the functionality of version 2.0, it implements
 various iteration algorithms that roll back FMU slaves and increase
 stability of coupled simulations.
 .
 The package contains the command-line solver (mastersim), the
 graphical user interface (mastersim-gui) and example projects.
